cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "Actionable SMP: a Software Management Plan a machine can check"
abstract: >-
  A static, client-side web tool and command-line checker for machine-actionable
  Software Management Plans. It turns the questions, requirements and management
  levels of the Practical guide to Software Management Plans (Martinez-Ortiz et al.,
  2023) into smp.json, a plan whose envelope follows the RDA DMP Common Standard,
  and checks every commitment the plan marks as in place against the files of the
  repository it describes, locally, in the browser against GitHub, or as a GitHub
  Action. Code under MIT; schema and texts under CC BY 4.0. Available in
  English and Spanish. The tool runs at https://rijdho.github.io/smp-template/.
